# The Microsoft Store's screenshots (1920 x 1080 with the window's menu bar). Written for Windows at 100 % scale, run
# on a copy of the demo collection (tools/mn-shots/store/README.md). The harness makes the window taller by the menu
# bar and lowers every point by it, so the points below are the manual's.
size 1920 1058
wait 1.5
note Welcome
wait 1.2
shot store-1-note
note Review - Reel 2
wait 1.5
click 700 400
wait 0.8
shot store-2-video
note Schedule
wait 1
click 640 169
wait 0.4
columnkind 1
wait 0.8
click 640 169
wait 0.4
key Escape
wait 0.4
click 721 102
wait 1
move 1400 900
wait 0.4
shot store-3-board
canvas Moodboard
wait 1.5
key cmd+0
wait 1
move 1400 1000
wait 0.3
shot store-4-canvas
note Delivery specs
wait 1.5
dclick 700 330
wait 2.5
wheel 900 500 200
wait 1.5
move 900 1040
wait 0.3
shot store-5-pdf
key Escape
wait 0.5
quit
